e_by_y` | [ ] |\n| 30 | `c2RaytoCapsule` | diagonal / horizontal / reversed capsule axis, `r` ∈ {0, small, huge} (axes J+K) | `cfg_30_raytocapsule_axis_shapes` | [ ] |\n| 31 | `c2RaytoCapsule` | fully random bit patterns (incl. `a==b`, NaN, inf) | `cfg_31_raytocapsule_random_bits` | [ ] |\n| 32 | `c2CastRay` | `typeB=C2_TYPE_CIRCLE` — random rays/circles, result compared to the direct `c2RaytoCircle` call as well | `cfg_32_castray_circle` | [ ] |\n| 33 | `c2CastRay` | `typeB=C2_TYPE_AABB` — random rays/boxes | `cfg_33_castray_aabb` | [ ] |\n| 34 | `c2CastRay` | `typeB=C2_TYPE_CAPSULE` — random rays/capsules | `cfg_34_castray_capsule` | [ ] |\n| 35 | `c2CastRay` | the three valid modes interleaved in one random stream, `out` reused across calls (state carry-over) | `cfg_35_castray_mixed_stream` | [ ] |\n| 36 | `spec_ray` | random mouse point / circle / ray origin: hit configuration | `cfg_36_spec_ray_hit` | [ ] |\n| 37 | `spec_ray` | miss configuration (circle behind or beyond the mouse point) | `cfg_37_spec_ray_miss` | [ ] |\n| 38 | `spec_ray` | grid sweep of exact integer coordinates (ties, `t == A.t` boundary) | `cfg_38_spec_ray_integer_grid` | [ ] |\n| 39 | `spec_ray` | fully random bit patterns for all 7 floats (NaN/inf/denormal heavy) | `cfg_39_spec_ray_random_bits` | [ ] |\n| 40 | all raycasts | `out` pre-filled with a poison pattern and *not* reset between calls — proves which fields each path writes (axis M) | `cfg_40_out_poison_write_tracking` | [ ] |\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
